  "text_md": "  <tr>\n  </tr>\n<table>\n- 4. After the control enclosure is successfully added to the system, a success message is displayed. Click Close to return to the System Overview view, as shown in Figure 4-24. The view displays two control enclosures configured on the system.\nThere are two methods of user authentication to control access to the GUI and to the CLI:\n</table>\n- Figure 4-23 Select Enclosure window: available control enclosures\nLocal authentication is performed within the Storwize V7000 system. Local GUI authentication is done with user name and password. Local CLI authentication is done either with an SSH public key or a user name and password.\n  <tr>",
